      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Pa-pa-pa-da, pa-pa-pa-da",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Pa-pa-pa-da, pa-pa-pa-da",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Pa-pa-pa-da, pa-pa-pa",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Pa-pa-pa",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Bring the beat in",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Honey, honey",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I can see the stars all the way from here",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Can't you see the glow on the window pane?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I can feel the sun whenever you're near",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Every time you touch me, I just melt away",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Now everybody asks me",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Why I'm smilin' out from ear to ear (They say love hurts)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But I know (It's gonna take a little work)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Oh, woah",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Nothin's perfect, but it's worth it",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "After fightin' through my tears",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And finally, you put me first",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Baby, it's you (Oh)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You're the one I love (I love)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You're the one I need (I need)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You're the only one I see",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Come on, baby, it's you (It's you)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You're the one that gives your all",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You're the one I can always call (Always calls)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "When I need, you make everything stop",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Finally, you put my love on top",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
